      "text": "\n\nSubject: Update on your export request\n\nHi [Name],\n\nI am writing to let you know that the export feature you requested will be available one week later than originally scheduled.\n\nDuring our final validation phase, we identified a data-integrity issue that could have caused specific records to be omitted or misaligned in the exported file. We decided to pause the release to ensure the data you receive is accurate. We take full responsibility for this oversight, and we apologize for the delay.\n\n**What is being done:**\nOur engineering team is currently implementing a fix to address the integrity check. Once the fix is in place, we will run a full re-validation cycle to confirm that all data points are correctly mapped and preserved.\n\n**What to expect next:**\nWe expect to have the feature ready for release by [Date, one week from now]. We will send a separate confirmation email as soon as the feature is live.\n\n**For urgent cases:**\nIf you have a time-sensitive need for this data before the new release date, please reply to this email or contact our support team directly. We can manually generate the export for you to ensure you have the information you need in the interim.\n\nThank you for your patience while we ensure this is done correctly.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Title]",
